%% 图 3-9 模块一：用户与权限模块 详细设计类图
classDiagram
    direction LR

    class User {
        +int64 ID
        +string Username
        -string PasswordHash
        +string RealName
        +string StudentNo
        +string Role
        +int CreditScore
        +string Status
        +ToPublic() UserPublic
    }

    class UserPublic {
        +int64 ID
        +string Username
        +string RealName
        +string Role
    }

    class Claims {
        +int64 UID
        +string Username
        +string Role
        +Time ExpiresAt
    }

    class AuthService {
        +Register(req) UserPublic
        +Login(req) LoginResponse
        +Logout(token)
        +ParseToken(token) Claims
        -IsTokenBlacklisted(hash) bool
    }

    class AuthMiddleware {
        +RequireLogin() Middleware
        +RequireAdmin() Middleware
        +RequireStudent() Middleware
        -CheckBlacklist(token) bool
    }

    class AdminUserService {
        +ListUsers() UserPublic[]
        +SetUserStatus(id, status)
    }

    class UserRepository {
        +ExistsByUsername(name) bool
        +GetByUsername(name) User
        +GetByID(id) User
        +Insert(u) User
        +UpdateStatus(id, status)
    }

    class TokenBlacklist {
        -redis Client
        +Add(tokenHash, ttl)
        +Has(tokenHash) bool
    }

    AuthService ..> UserRepository : 读写用户
    AuthService ..> Claims : 签发/解析令牌
    AuthService ..> TokenBlacklist : 注销写入
    AuthMiddleware ..> AuthService : 校验令牌与角色
    AuthMiddleware ..> TokenBlacklist : 拦截失效令牌
    AdminUserService ..> UserRepository : 用户管理
    User ..> UserPublic : 输出公开信息
    Claims "1" --* "1" LoginResponse : 携带
